this off.

Episode tags (canon, filler, recap) use MyAnimeList (https://myanimelist.net)
episode data, read through the Jikan-compatible APIs Tenrai
(https://tenrai.org), jikan-edge (https://jikan.lucashdo.com) and Jikan
(https://jikan.moe). The data belongs to MyAnimeList and is not part of this
program: the server fetches it at runtime for the anime being viewed and
caches it in its data directory. Garceslab Anime is not affiliated with
MyAnimeList, Jikan, Tenrai or jikan-edge. Set SEANIME_EPISODE_TAGS_DISABLED=true
to turn this off.

